# Editor/tool-generated local artifacts — never commit
.claude/
docs/.claude/
docs/graph-architecture.md

# Apple signing credentials — a .p8 App Store Connect key is a real private
# key. Keep it outside the repository entirely; this is a backstop, not the
# storage location.
*.p8

# Claude Design sync — staged converter scripts (regenerated per clone),
# build output, and machine state. .design-sync/ itself is NOT ignored: it
# holds the durable, committed sync config/notes/previews.
#
# .ds-sync/ is mostly regenerated (the skill's own package-build.mjs/lib/
# staged via `cp -r`) but hosts 3 repo-owned files a fresh clone cannot do
# without — see .design-sync/NOTES.md "Why entry.mjs/tsconfig-preview.json/
# next-link-stub.tsx live in .ds-sync/, not .design-sync/". Ignore the
# directory, then explicitly un-ignore those three.
.ds-sync/*
!.ds-sync/entry.mjs
!.ds-sync/tsconfig-preview.json
!.ds-sync/next-link-stub.tsx
ds-bundle/
.design-sync/.cache/
.design-sync/learnings/
.design-sync/node_modules
